### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-split
### The terminal UI: split and join files (Phase T7).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-split.ftl.

## Split / join dialog

tui-split-custom = Custom size
tui-split-output = Output folder
# $path: the file to split; $size: its size ("…" while it is read).
tui-split-file = File: { $path } · { $size }
tui-split-hints = Up/Down part size · Tab fields · Enter split · Esc cancel
tui-split-join-hints = Tab fields · Enter join · Esc cancel
tui-split-running-hints = Esc stop (partial output is removed)
tui-split-done-hints = Enter / Esc close
